              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Known? (nōtus, nōta, nōtum.) Famous? (celeber, celebris, celebre.) Honourable? (honestus, honesta, honestum.) Middle? (medius, media, medium.) Highest? (summus, summa, summum.) Wasteful? (prōdigus, prōdiga, prōdigum.) Moderate? (modestus, modesta, modestum.) Eloquent? (fācundus, fācunda, fācundum.) Mute? (mūtus, mūta, mūtum.) Lame? (claudus, clauda, claudum.) A storeroom? (cella, cellae.) A study? (tablīnum, tablīnī.) A colonnaded garden? (peristylium, peristyliī.) A rain basin? (impluvium, impluviī.) A foundation? (fundāmentum, fundāmentī.) A helmsman? (gubernātor, gubernātōris.) A market? (mercātus, mercātūs.) A weight? (pondus, ponderis.) A measure? (mēnsūra, mēnsūrae.) A pound; a pair of scales? (lībra, lībrae.)"
